  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 1003.05 Application Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 1003.05 Application Requirements.\n\n(a) A municipality or approved local or regional entity seeking HWCF monies for a HHW collection project shall complete and submit, between October 1 and February 1 prior to the fiscal year in which the project is planned to occur, Form HWM-7 “Household Hazardous Waste Grant Application” as amended February 2026.\n\n(b) The department shall make available:\n\n(1) Guidance for completing the application and for planning and hosting a HHW collection project;\n\n(2) A suggested warrant article for allocating matching funds; and\n\n(3) Examples of press releases, fliers, advertisements, and other educational materials to facilitate the required educational component.\n\nSource. #5053, eff 1-24-91; ss by #5886, eff 8-26-94; amd by #6384-B, eff 11-26-96; ss by #7333, eff 8-1-00; ss by #9215, INTERIM, eff 8-1-08, EXPIRES: 1-28-09; ss by #9367, eff 1-28-09; amd by #10205, eff 10-19-12; ss by #12352, eff 8-14-17; ss by #14284, eff 8-1-25; ss by #14528, eff 2-28-26, EXPIRES: 2-28-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-hw1000.html"
